#: ../../maths/index.md:1 e1e074f19cbb40778176d6311c746f5d
msgid "Notation and conventions"
msgstr "符號與慣例"

#: ../../maths/index.md:3 2fb4900353fc4c698a9aaab2357b955d
msgid "These pages give the mathematics behind every number this application can ask for. They are written to be read beside the interface: each one says which control feeds which symbol, and where the formula lives in QuantLib's own source, so a claim here can be checked against the code that produced the price."
msgstr "這幾頁說明本應用程式所能索取的每一個數字背後的數學。它們寫成可以對照介面閱讀：每一頁都說明哪個控制項餵給哪個符號，以及公式在 QuantLib 原始碼中的位置，因此這裡的每項主張都能對照產生該價格的程式碼查證。"

#: ../../maths/index.md:9 58ff23722106468f995afbc89c8621e4
msgid "Citations of the form `ql/pricingengines/...` are paths inside the QuantLib checkout vendored in the backend repository at `third_party/QuantLib`, pinned at **v1.43**."
msgstr "形如 `ql/pricingengines/...` 的引用，指的是後端專案中以子模組形式放在 `third_party/QuantLib`、固定在 **v1.43** 的 QuantLib 原始碼路徑。"

